/-! ## Mod-5 residue factors for Rogers-Ramanujan (Ch7 dependency)

The classical R-R proof needs:
`(q;q)_∞ = ∏_{k=1..5} (q^k;q^5)_∞`.

Each factor `(q^k;q^5)_∞` = `∏'_n (1 - q^(k + 5n))` for `n ≥ 0`. -/

/-- For ‖q‖ < 1 and k ≥ 1: `Summable fun n => ‖-q^k · (q^5)^n‖`. -/
